 Q("Are tables converted?","Yes. Tables become bordered PDF tables with a shaded header row; cell text wraps."),
 Q("Why are my images missing?","Images linked by path or URL are not fetched for privacy; embed them as data URIs or add them to the PDF afterwards."),
 Q("Can I convert several .md files at once?","Yes. Each file becomes its own PDF and they download together as a ZIP."),
 Q("Is the text in the PDF searchable?","Yes, it is real text you can search, select and copy."),
